# Numeric initializer tables are data, not function parameter lists.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++11
ColumnLimit: 300
IndentWidth: 2
ContinuationIndentWidth: 2
BracedInitializerIndentWidth: 2
TabWidth: 2
UseTab: Never
NamespaceIndentation: All
SortIncludes:
  Enabled: false
ReflowComments: Never
FixNamespaceComments: false
